 "brief": "Shehab Wire reports that a documentary film titled NAZA exposes the scale of crimes committed in Gaza by presenting testimony from perpetrators themselves. The film challenges the Israeli military narrative that has accompanied the war since its inception—claims of a force that avoids civilians, carries out precise strikes, and causes only unavoidable casualties.\n\nThe documentary's most dangerous revelation, according to the report, is not merely the volume of alleged atrocities documented in Gaza, but its demolition of Israel's official account of military operations through the words of soldiers involved in the fighting.",
